      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So, to build on this idea a bit....\n\n- Can be spawned in on worlds that allow vehicles (requires that to be added to SDK as World Modifier - no modifier = no vehicles)\n- Set a poly limit around 15k?\n- Land and Aerial vehicle options. Both control a specific way, that can't be modified. This allows consistency, reduces the chances things will break, and makes things fair if someone wanted to make , say, a race track world.\n\nYou know what would be rad? If VRChat added support for a vehicle system. \n- Vehicles separate from Avatars\n- Can be spawned in on worlds that allow vehicles (requires that to be added to SDK as World Modifier)\n- Set a poly limit around 20k?\n- Land and Aerial vehicle options. Both control a specific way, that can't be modified\n- Add an example to SDK\n\nIt'd be cool, cuz people could get crazy creative with it. Spawn in vehicles from their favorite games, or make their own. With custom animations you could do a lot of cool stuff too. Maybe even allow multiple VRC Stations so friends can ride with you, and add the option to let randoms/friends/no one hop in your vehicle from the player menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
