  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-07-20T21:49:55.788Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I had a thought. What if you create a secondary avatar page that is for spawning vehicles and mounts. Of course your team can put up a few public examples and those proficient in Unity could create their own. Perhaps it could work like in the Destiny Franchise where the vehicle will spawn and only be usable by the \"spawny\" and if left unused will de-spawn. Think of the possiblities: cars to move around the big maps more quickly, mounts that can traverse the cliffs and hills of outdoor maps, and air-types to soar through the skies or vastness of space in the open air maps. I have seen viable examples of these in user created worlds and I think it would be a shot in the arm of the game, bringing in new users and bringing back former users.",
